 "note": "The background image (World.png) is a clean, pre-made combined Kalimdor/Eastern Kingdoms world map from https://wowforeveratlas.com/media/forever-maps/azeroth.webp (no UI chrome to remove - it's a purpose-built atlas image, not a client screenshot). The two landmasses' size, shape and relative position are authentic WoW Forever cartography. Zone marker POSITIONS within this image are still an approximation: no game-data table in this build places individual zones relative to this specific combined view (see docs/plans/world-map-notes.md), so each zone's already-correct fractional position within its own continent's native extracted frame (real UiMapAssignment data) was remapped onto a hand-estimated bounding box for that continent's landmass within this image. Verified by plotting all 46 markers and confirming each lands on its correct landmass in a plausible relative position."
